    "UIName": "Crab 'Peekaboo'",
    "Id": "mechdef_crab_CRB-PAB",
    "Name": "Crab CRB-PAB",
    "Details": "Peekaboo! is what the Pilot of this Particular Crab would say, if they got Enemies in the Crosshair of their Guns. Built to Endure, Hurt and Overcome most Obstacles, this Crab is a Force Multiplier to be Reckoned with. Its also said to be Cursed, If you do the Phrase Mockingly or not with full intent, the Mech apparently shuts down. This is but Superstition, as there are No Commands or other Files within the Mech that follow those Parameters.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_crab"
  },
